{"id":"390faad2d7c5267a","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-top2-path-connected-space.md","title":"ZFC Top2 Path Connected Space","display":"df-zfc-top2-path-connected-space — ZFC Top2 Path Connected Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top2-path-connected-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top2-path-connected-space"],"display":"df-zfc-top2-path-connected-space — ZFC Top2 Path Connected Space","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top2-path-connected-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top2-path-connected-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top2-path-connected-space — ZFC Top2 Path Connected Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,\\tau_{\\mathbb I}\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,\\tau_{\\mathbb I}\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb I=[0,1]\">\\(\\mathbb I=[0,1]\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb I}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb I}\\)</span> is the Euclidean subspace topology defined below</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\)</span> are the two- and five-place predicates from the displayed dependencies</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2PathConnectedSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2PathConnectedSpace}_S\\)</span> is the two-place predicate defined below</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top2\\text{-}unit\\text{-}interval\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\\tau_{\\mathbb I}\\coloneqq\\left\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb I:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\bigl((x-\\varepsilon,x+\\varepsilon)\\cap\\mathbb I\\subseteq U\\bigr)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top2\\text{-}unit\\text{-}interval\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\\tau_{\\mathbb I}\\coloneqq\\left\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb I:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\bigl((x-\\varepsilon,x+\\varepsilon)\\cap\\mathbb I\\subseteq U\\bigr)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top2\\text{-}path\\text{-}connected\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop2PathConnectedSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\exists f\\;(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,\\mathbb I,\\tau_{\\mathbb I},X,\\tau)\\land f(0)=x\\land f(1)=y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top2\\text{-}path\\text{-}connected\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop2PathConnectedSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\exists f\\;(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,\\mathbb I,\\tau_{\\mathbb I},X,\\tau)\\land f(0)=x\\land f(1)=y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>任意两点都由从标准单位区间到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的连续映射连接；端点条件固定路径方向，但反向重参数化表明方向不影响性质。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,\\tau_{\\mathbb I}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb I=[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathbb I}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2PathConnectedSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top2\\text{-}unit\\text{-}interval\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\\tau_{\\mathbb I}\\coloneqq\\left\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb I:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\bigl((x-\\varepsilon,x+\\varepsilon)\\cap\\mathbb I\\subseteq U\\bigr)\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top2\\text{-}path\\text{-}connected\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop2PathConnectedSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\exists f\\;(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,\\mathbb I,\\tau_{\\mathbb I},X,\\tau)\\land f(0)=x\\land f(1)=y)","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":1563,"backlinks":[{"id":"79ff7dbb102de85a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bbb7afdb7f97034e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3542","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-top2-path-connected-space.md|58-df-zfc-top2-path-connected-space]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","74086485fba8d86f","3cd1834de4f2efb2"]}